Date: Mon, 5 Jan 2026 16:07:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] [add_column()][CREATE FUNCTION] add remote mode, get
 serialized udf payload and store in the '__all_routine' system table

Signed-off-by: He Su <yefengshuo.yfs@oceanbase.com>
---
 deps/oblib/src/lib/ob_define.h                |  1 +
 .../inner_table/ob_inner_table_schema_def.py  |  3 ++
 src/share/schema/ob_routine_info.h            |  8 ++++
 src/share/schema/ob_routine_sql_service.cpp   | 38 ++++++++++++++++---
 .../ddl/ob_create_routine_resolver.cpp        | 21 +++++++---
 .../resolver/ddl/ob_create_routine_resolver.h |  2 +-
